  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Reach for Change for project Empowering Women</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Reach for Change f&#xf6;r projektet Empowering Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Reach for Change 2025-2027 for the &#x201c;Empowering Women Social Entrepreneurs&#x201d; project. The project aims to strengthen female entrepreneurship, especially among internally displaced persons, in Ukraine. This is to improve the living situation of vulnerable groups and to promote economic development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Reach for Change 2025&#x2013;2027 f&#xf6;r projektet &#x201d;Empowering Women Social Entrepreneurs&#x201d;. Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka kvinnligt f&#xf6;retagande, s&#xe4;rskilt bland internflyktingar, i Ukraina. Detta f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra levnadssituationen f&#xf6;r utsatta grupper och fr&#xe4;mja ekonomisk utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
